{%- doc -%}
  Prints the visitor's free-shipping state from the free_shipping_threshold theme setting (₪):
  - -1: every order ships free (the setting is 0),
  - a positive amount: orders ship free from that amount, in cents,
  - 0: no free-shipping promise applies: the setting is empty, the visitor is outside Israel (the
    only zone with a free rate in admin), or the cart is in another currency than the store's.
  0 is also what an empty or failed render reads as, so an error never becomes a free-shipping claim.
  Every free-shipping message (announcement bar, trust badges, product page, cart line or progress
  bar, set and upsell notes, empty cart, FAQ) goes through here.

  @example
  {% capture threshold_cents %}{% render 'free-shipping-cents' %}{% endcapture %}
  {% assign threshold_cents = threshold_cents | plus: 0 %}
  {% if threshold_cents < 0 %}(every order ships free){% elsif threshold_cents > 0 %}(free from that amount){% endif %}
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  assign cents = 0
  if settings.free_shipping_threshold != blank and settings.free_shipping_threshold >= 0
    if localization.country.iso_code == 'IL' and cart.currency.iso_code == shop.currency
      assign cents = settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100 | round
      if cents == 0
        assign cents = -1
      endif
    endif
  endif
  echo cents
-%}
